      <ReportItem port="443" svc_name="www" protocol="tcp" severity="4" pluginID="900101" pluginName="Northfold Portal Report API Executes Arbitrary SQL Statements" pluginFamily="CGI abuses">
        <cvss3_base_score>9.8</cvss3_base_score>
        <exploit_available>true</exploit_available>
        <synopsis>The portal's report API passes caller-supplied SQL to MySQL with the application account, which holds SUPER and FILE privileges.</synopsis>
        <solution>Remove free-form SQL from the report API and drop SUPER/FILE from the application account.</solution>
      </ReportItem>
